<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>ITALY, July 9 - Genoa - One bulk carrier awaiting berth, average delay 12 hours.</p>
<p>Savona - One vessel awaiting normal berth, no vessels awaiting special berth.</p>
<p>La Spezia - No vessels waiting.</p>
</text>
